# Specialized ensemble subcommands — `string length`/`compare`/`match`/
# `range` and `dict get` compile to direct opcodes (strlen, strcmp,
# strmatch, strrangeImm, dictGet) and emit no `::tcl::ENSEMBLE::*`
# literal. The walker correctly does not see them as ensemble dispatch.
# (PLAN_v2.1 §2.3 "Notable empirical finding" + ENSEMBLE_VERDICT.md.)
set s "hello"
string length $s
string compare $s "world"
set d {a 1 b 2}
dict get $d a
---
